### A. Búsqueda
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shows/search?search_query=girls

### B. Show por id (usa la caché de Mongo)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shows/139

### C. Guardar comentario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shows/139/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Muy buena serie",
  "rating": 5
}

### Error: rating fuera de rango (debe responder 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shows/139/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "Prueba",
  "rating": 8
}

### Error: show inexistente (debe responder 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shows/999999999